---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="BRCGS Food Safety Certification | Eurocert"
  description="Explore brcgs food safety certification with Eurocert, including requirements, audit or assessment stages, documentation, certification support."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/food-certification/brc/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Eurocert Asia,ISO certification,CE marking,food safety certification,FSSC 22000,BRCGS,GFSI,social audits,Sedex,SMETA,SA8000,inspection services,certification body,India,management systems,ISO 9001,ISO 14001,ISO 45001"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367620/eurocert/F14.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="BRCGS"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Brand Reputation through Compliance Global Standards</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">BRCGS<!-- --> <span class="text-eurogold-400">Certification</span></h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">BRCGS Global Food Safety Standard is a GFSI-benchmarked certification recognized by leading retailers worldwide. It demonstrates your organization&#x27;s commitment to product safety, integrity, legality, and quality.</p></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-stretch"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Standard Overview</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">BRCGS Global Standard<!-- --> <span class="text-euro-600">for Food Safety</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">BRCGS (Brand Reputation through Compliance Global Standards), formerly known as BRC, was rebranded in 2019 by the British Retail Consortium. What began as a standard for retailer-branded product suppliers has now evolved into a globally accepted benchmark, with over 30,000 certified sites across 130+ countries.</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">The standard provides a structured framework to ensure food safety, quality, and operational excellence across the supply chain. As a GFSI-recognized scheme, it is widely accepted by major retailers in the UK, Europe, and globally. Eurocert Asia supports organizations with gap assessments, implementation guidance, and certification and surveillance audits.</p><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/40"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-info-circle text-white text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">What is BRCGS?</h4></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">The BRCGS Global Standard for Food Safety defines detailed requirements for food safety management systems, HACCP-based food safety plans, quality management systems, and facility and operational controls. It emphasizes senior management commitment, risk-based thinking, process control and traceability, and staff training and competence. Certification assures stakeholders that your operations meet internationally recognized food safety standards.</p></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 flex min-h-[400px] lg:min-h-0 group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367942/eurocert/bcrg.png.png" class="w-full h-full transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105 object-contain" alt="BRCGS"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-8 lg:py-12 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-slate-100"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367715/eurocert/Gemini_Generated_Image_jbhid6jbhid6jbhi.png.png" alt="BRCGS" class="w-full h-auto object-contain"/></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Key BRCGS Requirements</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">BRCGS<!-- --> <span class="text-euro-600">Certification Areas</span></h2><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Comprehensive BRCGS Audit and Certification Support</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-users text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Senior Management &amp; Continual Improvement</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Strong leadership involvement in food safety culture and continuous improvement systems.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">HACCP-Based Food Safety Plan</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Implementation of a robust HACCP plan covering hazard analysis and critical control points.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Food Safety &amp; Quality Management</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Effective documentation, internal audits, and corrective action systems.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-building text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Site Standards &amp; Facility Audit</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Evaluation of infrastructure, hygiene, product flow, and environmental controls.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-barcode text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Product Control &amp; Traceability</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive systems for allergen control, product testing, and traceability.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-cogs text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Process Control &amp; Personnel Training</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ensuring controlled processes and well-trained staff for consistent quality and safety.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Certification Benefits</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Benefits of <span class="text-euro-600">BRCGS Certification</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-globe text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Global Recognition</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Accepted by major retailers worldwide.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">GFSI Benchmarked</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Aligned with global food safety requirements.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-store text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Market Access</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Essential for suppliers targeting UK and European markets.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Risk Reduction</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Minimizes operational and food safety risks.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-[#f8fafc] rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 shrink-0 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chart-line text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-1">Continuous Improvement</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Enhances efficiency through structured processes.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Trusted Certification Partner</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Why Choose Eurocert for <span class="text-eurogold-400">BRCGS<!-- -->?</span></h3></div><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-white font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest">Expert Certification</h4></div><p class="text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed">Our qualified auditors bring deep industry expertise, offering thorough audits, practical recommendations, and clear and actionable reporting. We focus not just on compliance, but on long-term improvement and value creation.</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-globe-asia text-eurogold-400 text-sm"></i></div>